{"candidateAnswer":"Candles, essential oils, music, mindful breathing, serene space, yoga props","evidence":"[D11:4 | 4:03 pm on 28 March, 2023] Deborah: That`s cool! I also bought this candle for the atmosphere and to improve my yoga practice. How about you? When you do it, what feelings do you get?\n[D11:7 | 4:03 pm on 28 March, 2023] Jolene: I find music helps me. Any favorite tracks?\n[D28:16 | 3:09 pm on 15 September, 2023] Jolene:  I like to create my own serene yoga space with candles and oils for extra chill vibes. Also, we tried a new style of meditation in Thailand - with flowers.\n[D28:18 | 3:09 pm on 15 September, 2023] Jolene: I find calm when I do yoga or meditate. I use essential oils and put on some soft, soothing music in the background to create a peaceful atmosphere. It really helps me chill out and center myself.","itemId":"urn:uuid:99082f7e-124b-51a8-9be8-b02e41699714","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f6272f147f16e4ae8fa5cada97a9ee9112ccb69e7634f60af4b0a8e5d6e87adb","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What ways do Deborah and Jolene use to enhance their yoga practice?","referenceAnswer":"candles, music, essential oils","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f6272f147f16e4ae8fa5cada97a9ee9112ccb69e7634f60af4b0a8e5d6e87adb"}}]}